"Android apps, on your iPhone." = "Android 应用，跑在你的 iPhone 上。";
"Android cannot reshape a screen once it is running, so a landscape game on a portrait screen gets letterboxed into a band and looks tiny. Creating it landscape is the only way it can fill it — portrait apps are letterboxed instead. Costs one cold boot." = "Android 一旦运行就无法改变屏幕形状，因此竖屏上的横屏游戏会被压成一条带、显得很小。只有以横屏创建才能填满屏幕——竖屏应用则会被加黑边。需要一次冷启动。";
"Android draws on the real GPU through Metal — about four times the frame rate. This is the default." = "Android 通过 Metal 在真实 GPU 上绘制，帧率约为四倍。这是默认设置。";
"Android installs it from where it already is — nothing is copied." = "Android 会从它原本所在的位置安装，不会复制任何文件。";
