"Android needs memory it can write and then run, which on iOS only an attached debugger can grant. Choose how your %@ gets one." = "Android 需要可写后运行的内存，而在 iOS 上只有附加的调试器才能授予。请选择你的 %@ 以哪种方式获得它。";
"Android reaches the internet through a virtual ethernet card on QEMU's own network. Nothing on your phone's network can see the guest, and the guest cannot see it." = "Android 通过 QEMU 自有网络上的虚拟网卡访问互联网。你手机网络上的任何设备都看不到来宾系统，来宾系统也看不到它们。";
"Android will boot from cold once, then save a new one." = "Android 会冷启动一次，然后保存一份新的快照。";
"Android's native code expects things of the processor and of memory that only the phone can answer -- above all, whether a library's code can run with its data writable right beside it. Enable JIT first, or the memory checks are skipped. The results go to the console too." = "Android 的原生代码对处理器和内存有一些只有手机才能回答的要求——最重要的是：一个库的代码能否与其可写数据紧邻运行。请先启用 JIT，否则会跳过内存检查。结果也会输出到控制台。";
