"Husk needs its Android runtime — about 760 MB. Android itself is downloaded afterwards by the runtime." = "Husk 需要它的 Android 运行时，约 760 MB。Android 系统本身会在之后由运行时下载。";
"Husk needs memory it can write and then execute, which on iOS takes an attached debugger. There are two ways to get it: a debugger that services trap requests, or a MAP_JIT mapping, which the kernel allows any debugged process. Either one is enough — which is available depends on the device and the iOS version, so Husk tests both rather than assuming." = "Husk 需要可写后执行的内存，这在 iOS 上需要附加的调试器。有两种途径：由调试器处理陷入请求，或使用 MAP_JIT 映射（内核允许任何被调试进程使用）。两者有其一即可——哪一种可用取决于设备和 iOS 版本，因此 Husk 会实测两者而不做假设。";
"Husk pretends to be a computer on your Wi-Fi, and your %@ pairs with it the way it would with a Mac." = "Husk 在你的 Wi-Fi 上伪装成一台电脑，你的 %@ 会像与 Mac 配对那样与它配对。";
"Husk restores a saved machine instead of booting it, which takes seconds rather than minutes. The picture freezes while it writes. With this off, nothing saves by itself — including after an install." = "Husk 会恢复已保存的机器而不是重新启动，只需几秒而非几分钟。写入期间画面会冻结。关闭此项后不会自动保存——安装之后也不会。";
"Husk runs a real Android system and opens APKs inside it. A few questions first — all of them can be changed later in Settings." = "Husk 运行真实的 Android 系统，并在其中打开 APK。先回答几个问题——之后都可以在“设置”中更改。";
"Husk runs unmodified Android APKs in a real Android system on your iPhone. The console shows Husk's live log, the guest's serial output and QEMU's own output — the three files any problem here is diagnosed from." = "Husk 在你的 iPhone 上运行真实 Android 系统，并运行未经修改的 Android APK。控制台显示 Husk 的实时日志、来宾系统的串口输出以及 QEMU 自身的输出——排查问题所需的三部分都在这里。";
"Husk was marked as debugged when it opened, so JIT is on." = "Husk 启动时已被标记为调试状态，因此 JIT 已开启。";
"Husk's helper reaches this %@'s debugging service through a local VPN. Nothing leaves your %@." = "Husk 的辅助进程通过本地 VPN 访问这台 %@ 的调试服务。任何数据都不会离开你的 %@。";
"If JIT is not on when Android starts, Husk turns it on with the method you chose, or walks you through setting one up. You can change it any time in Settings › JIT & sideload." = "如果 Android 启动时 JIT 未开启，Husk 会使用你选择的方式开启，或引导你完成设置。随时可在“设置 › JIT 与侧载”中更改。";
