"On a jailbroken device JIT is a setting. In Dopamine, turn on Allow JIT in Apps, then open Husk again." = "在已越狱的设备上，JIT 只是一项设置。在 Dopamine 中开启“允许应用使用 JIT”，然后重新打开 Husk。";
