"The game starts with nothing over it: no bar, no controller, no readout, the picture to every edge. Tap with three fingers at once to bring the bar back, and again to hide it. The Hide button in the bar does the same while playing, but leaves the strip the bar sat in." = "游戏启动时不叠加任何界面：没有工具栏、没有控制器、没有读数，画面铺满边缘。三指同时点按可唤回工具栏，再次点按则隐藏。游戏进行中点按工具栏里的“隐藏”按钮效果相同，但会保留工具栏所占的那一条。";
"The list is written to disk, so it is on screen before Android has finished starting." = "列表会写入磁盘，因此在 Android 启动完成之前就能在屏幕上看到。";
"The pairing file stays in Husk's Documents folder and is only sent to Husk's own helper." = "配对文件保存在 Husk 的 Documents 文件夹里，只会发送给 Husk 自己的辅助进程。";
"The panel is built when the machine starts, so a change costs one cold boot, and the next save replaces the machine saved at the old size — changing back costs another. Sizes are rounded to a multiple of eight. Bigger is slower: every pixel is drawn by an emulated phone. Android's density does not change with the panel, so a larger one shows more rather than bigger." = "面板在机器启动时构建，因此修改需要一次冷启动，而下次保存会替换按旧尺寸保存的机器——改回去又要再冷启动一次。尺寸会取整为 8 的倍数。越大越慢：每个像素都由模拟手机绘制。Android 的密度不随面板改变，因此更大的面板是显示更多内容，而不是更大。";
"The plan, in order, is docs/04-translation-layer.md in Husk's source." = "完整的计划见 Husk 源码中的 docs/04-translation-layer.md。";
